abstract: >-
  Experimental records, reference implementations, analysis and recomputation scripts,
  derived data, and figure plotting data for a study of online execution-time calibration
  and its effect on deadline outcomes in heterogeneous GPU pools. The repository contains
  the two archives supplied with the manuscript, extracted: the main reproducibility
  package (three-host deployment records, replay results, four CPU experiment sets,
  supplemental analyses, H-event extracts) and the TF32 software-path diagnostic package.
